  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'m structuring the codebase by defining core data structures. Currently, I\'m focused on creating types for key entities like `DisasterSite`, `Vehicle`, `Route`, `RouteStop`, and `OptimizationResult`. This will be housed in `/src/types.ts`. I am also working on mock data.\n\n\n**Mapping the Operations**\n\nI\'m now mapping out the operational components. I am developing `/src/services/vrpSolver.ts`, which will house the routing optimization engine. This will implement CVRPTW to calculate the travel matrix, time windows, capacity constraints and a multi-objective cost function to generate optimal stop sequences, route timelines, and load percentages. The comparisons will be against a nearest-neighbor baseline. Furthermore, I am designing the Express backend server at `/server.ts` to interact with this solver, incorporating endpoints for site and vehicle management, optimization triggering, and even an intake agent utilizing the Gemini API.\n\n\n**Designing the Endpoints**\n\nI\'m currently designing the API endpoints. I am working on `/api/agent/prioritize`, `/api/agent/dispatch`, and `/api/agent/chat` which utilize an agent for prioritization, dispatch, and interactive Q&A regarding current routes. The `/api/agent/pipeline` endpoint will run the full multi-agent pipeline from intake to dispatch generation. The other endpoints include `/api/demo-reports`, `/api/reset`, and the Vite Express middleware.\n\n\n\n**Visualizing the Frontend**\n\nI\'m now diving into the frontend visualization components. I am developing a map using Leaflet that color-codes site markers by urgency and displays route lines. The `/src/components/AgentPipelineTracker.tsx` component shows the multi-agent workflow pipeline status. A report submission box is designed in `/src/components/ReportIntakePanel.tsx`, and `/src/components/RouteOverviewPanel.tsx` offers detailed route cards.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 690997560
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
