  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the VRP Solver**\n\nI\'m currently focused on building the `/src/services/vrpSolver.ts` file. This will be the core of our Operations Research Vehicle Routing Solver Engine. My priority is to create a robust and accurate implementation of the Capacitated Vehicle Routing Problem with Time Windows. This is a critical step, as it will impact the model significantly.\n\n\n**Defining the Heuristic**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of the Windows algorithm within `/src/services/vrpSolver.ts`. I\'ve outlined the core steps: filtering fulfilled sites, calculating distance matrices using the Haversine formula, and introducing a priority weighting system based on urgency scores. This weighting incorporates time penalties for delayed sites, especially those with high urgency scores needing early prioritization.\n\n\n"
