  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have built **ReliefRoute** based on the implementation plan, bringing together an Operations Research Vehicle Routing Problem (VRP) solver with Gemini multi-agent intelligence and a live tactical map interface.\n\n### Summary of Accomplishments\n\n- **Operations Research VRP Optimization Engine (`/src/services/vrpSolver.ts`)**:\n  - Implements Capacitated Vehicle Routing Problem with Time Windows (CVRPTW) algorithms with 2-Opt local search refinement.\n  - Accounts for vehicle cargo capacities, speed limits, Haversine travel distances with road curvature factors, and site urgency penalties.\n  - Automatically compares optimized routes against a naive nearest-neighbor baseline to compute **% Distance Saved** and **% Time Saved**.\n\n- **4-Agent Pipeline Workflow (`/server.ts`)**:\n  - **Intake Agent**: Uses server-side Gemini (`gemini-3.6-flash`) to parse messy free-text disaster reports into structured disaster sites (resources, affected counts, severity, coordinates).\n  - **Prioritization Agent**: Scores urgency from 0\342\200\223100 and computes strict target fulfillment windows.\n  - **Routing Solver**: Runs the OR optimization solver across active disaster sites and vehicle fleets.\n  - **Dispatch Agent**: Generates turn-by-turn plain language driver manifests and answers interactive officer inquiries.\n\n- **Interactive Tactical Grid & Satellite Map (`/src/components/MapContainer.tsx`)**:\n  - Live visual map rendering disaster sites color-coded by urgency (Critical red, High orange, Standard blue).\n  - Depot base marker with sequential vehicle route paths, stop order badges (`Stop #1`, `Stop #2`), and expandable site details.\n\n- **One-Click Demo Suite & Dispatch Assistant (`/src/components/ReportIntakePanel.tsx`, `/src/components/DispatchChat.tsx`)**:\n  - Pre-scripted demo scenario selector for one-click end-to-end pipeline execution during demonstrations.\n  - Interactive Q&A chat drawer enabling dispatchers to ask the AI assistant why specific routes or priorities were chosen."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
